  "1626010516": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "{PC}. After Mario got arrested, I went through his private files. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1201866398": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -2008180385,
    -1062037434,
    786635021
   ],
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "The ones even his lawyers didn’t know about. There was another person involved. Just an initial. E.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2008180385": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1201866398,
   "children": [
    -1785640005
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That must’ve been rough. What did you find?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1785640005": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2008180385,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It was. But I needed answers. And what I found matters more than my feelings right now.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1062037434": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1201866398,
   "children": [
    -295636957
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You sure this isn’t just paranoid nonsense?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-295636957": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1062037434,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I checked everything. Dates. Payments. Locations. This wasn’t paranoia. It was organized.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "786635021": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1201866398,
   "children": [
    1630102404
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Let me guess. Mysterious letter, evil vibes, dramatic pause.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1630102404": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 786635021,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I hate that you’re not wrong. But this isn’t a movie. These files were real. Detailed. Logged.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-694694298": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -204457702,
    959154114,
    951485044,
    -94665023
   ],
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Mario was funding hybrid research. Human DNA mixed with... I don't even want to know. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-204457702": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -694694298,
   "children": [
    -16568542
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why didn’t he finish the project?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "959154114": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -694694298,
   "children": [
    441332790
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Bigfoot is real!?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "951485044": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -694694298,
   "children": [
    1415664546
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "(Smart) Gene-splicing with incomplete ethical oversight. Typical.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareNumber",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareIntegers",
     "title": "If Traits[newtrait-Smart] ≥ 5",
     "fields": {
      "m_Value": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "newtrait-Smart",
        "list": "Traits",
        "type": "number"
       }
      },
      "m_CompareTo": {
       "m_Comparison": "GreaterOrEqual",
       "m_CompareTo": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 5
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "1415664546": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 951485044,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Exactly. No safeguards. No exit plans. People weren’t volunteers. They were assets.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "441332790": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 959154114,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I swear, if you say Bigfoot one more time, I’m revoking your help license. They’re not folklore.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-16568542": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -204457702,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Because they escaped. Or were helped. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-395841074": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "The records stop suddenly. But sightings keep popping up. Off the grid. Isolated.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-279605352": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1003441839,
    -545754313,
    -295524337,
    1877452281
   ],
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "I want to find them and make sure they’re okay.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1003441839": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -279605352,
   "children": [
    1514709043
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’m in. We’ll do this quietly.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1514709043": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1003441839,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Thank you. That actually means more than you know.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-545754313": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -279605352,
   "children": [
    516618583
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Okay. But if this spirals, we pull out.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "516618583": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -545754313,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Agreed. This is about helping. Not ruining lives.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-295524337": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -279605352,
   "children": [
    1418069335
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Let's hunt down some cryptids!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1418069335": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -295524337,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "You are impossible...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1611216687": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "We start with one lead. One location. And please. Try to keep the cryptid jokes to a minimum.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1806413181": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "If you want to help, I’d really like to meet you downtown on Tuesday. We can take it from there together.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1877452281": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -279605352,
   "children": [
    1814432640
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Maybe. I can't make any promises.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1814432640": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1877452281,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Fine, I know you're busy. But please, {PC}. We're the only ones who can fix the mess Mario left behind.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-94665023": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -694694298,
   "children": [
    2103776631
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That explains Cerise, the android Mario kept in his basement.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareBool",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareBooleans",
